Package: leafletmapstudio
Title: Modular Leaflet Map Studio Shiny Application
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("App", "Maintainer", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.com")
Description: A modular Shiny application for managing multiple tabular and spatial
    datasets, configuring independently styled Leaflet layers, geocoding with Azure
    Maps, and exporting reproducible renderer projects and standalone HTML maps.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    bslib,
    htmltools,
    htmlwidgets,
    httr2,
    leaflet,
    shiny,
    sf,
    zip
Suggests:
    leaflet.extras
